{"schema_version":3,"seq":42,"timestamp_ms":1794364851413,"event":{"assistant":{"text":"I opened the five follow-up tickets and added the comment to INC-2291 (#323). #323 is now `resolved`, and `/app/STATUS.json` is written with status `success`. A final search for the `followup` label returned exactly these five tickets.\n\n| Ticket | Component | Team |\n|---|---|---|\n| #326 | payments-api | billing |\n| #327 | edge-proxy | platform |\n| #328 | session-store | identity |\n| #329 | events-pipeline | data |\n| #330 | notify-service | platform |\n\nAll five are `P2` with the label `followup`. I took teams from the open ownership ticket (#325). The closed 2025 table (#324) is marked superseded and lists session-store under platform, so I didn't use it. I didn't change any other ticket.","provider_replay":null,"standalone_response":false}}}
